                                "sense_id": "229ecae8-c4d4-3f44-884e-a713604e622d",
                                "text": "Oh, Christopher rheumatism doth not seem to have made thee less esurient or sitient, when the hospitality of Glasgow, or of other gormandizing and boozing places, is within thy reach."
                            }
